OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Kinmount House mansion
OL,4,Alooks to expand wedding business
OL,5,
OL,6,FExpansion plans have been lodged to
OL,7,Fhelp support the "viable ongoing use
OL,8,Fand maintenance" of a category A-listed
OL,9,FGeorgian country mansion in the south
OL,10,Fof Scotland.
OL,12,FKinmount House, at Cummertrees near
OL,13,FAnnan, was built between 1813 and 1820
OL,14,Ffor the 6th Marquess of Queensberry.
OL,16,FIt is now an popular wedding venue with
OL,17,Fits pavilion capable of hosting up to
OL,18,F200 guests and a smaller site, The
OL,19,FCroft, for about 50.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
