OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric Kinmount House mansion
OL,4,Alooks to expand wedding business
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest plans would include a
OL,7,Fpermanent kitchen being put in place at
OL,8,Fthe smaller venue in order to ensure
OL,9,F"continued rural tourism activity and
OL,10,Flocal economic benefit".
